Usage: lcm bench run [options]

Run the benchmark against search and a grep baseline

Options:
  --project <path>     Project directory (default: cwd)
  --k <n>              Hit-rate cutoff (default: 5) (default: "5")
  --bench-file <file>  Benchmark file path (default: project memory directory)
  --json               Output structured JSON
  --union              Score against every checkout of this repository, not this
                       project alone
  -h, --help           display help for command
